    "description": "Overlooking a private beach, this luxury hotel is 2.4 km from the Museo Maya de Cancún and 11 km from the Dolphinaris Cancun.\nThe stylish, luxe rooms feature ocean views and desks, plus free Wi-Fi, flat-screen TVs and iPod docks; many include furnished balconies. Club-level rooms and suites provide access to an elegant lounge with floor-to-ceiling windows and complimentary snacks. Room service is available.\nThere are 9 restaurants and bars, including fine-dining options, a breezy poolside grill and a plush lounge/bar. A high-end spa offers treatments. There's also a fitness center, a pool and a sauna, plus tennis courts & kids' activities."
